# The order Netnyahoo's changes go into the Chromium tree (docs/cef-source-build.md › "The patch series").
# CEF's own patches to Chrome aren't here: CEF's patcher applies them in step 2, until the Chromium bump.
#
#   chromium <patch>  a patch to chromium/src, after ungoogled-chromium and domain substitution (step 4)
#   layer <dir>       our own files, copied in by <dir>/apply.sh (engine/<layer>/src mirrors chromium/src)
#
# Lines run top to bottom; a patch is made against the tree as every line above it leaves it.
# One concern per patch, named for it; a new patch goes where it belongs, not where its name sorts.

chromium chromium-autofill-card-touchbar.patch
chromium chromium-autofill-address-bubble-window.patch
chromium chromium-browser-view-hosted-fullscreen.patch
chromium chromium-device-chooser-hook.patch
chromium chromium-cast-dialog-hook.patch
chromium chromium-side-panel-hook.patch
chromium chromium-hidden-window-current-window.patch
chromium chromium-devtools-redock-display.patch
chromium chromium-devtools-window-title.patch
chromium chromium-extension-install-prompt-hook.patch
chromium chromium-extension-updates.patch
chromium chromium-extension-window-hidden.patch
chromium chromium-neterror-yahu.patch
chromium chromium-branding.patch
